---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Use">
	<main class="section">
		<div class="container panel" data-reveal>
			<h2>Terms of Use</h2>
			<p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				<strong>Last updated:</strong> 08 May 2026
			</p>
			<p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				These Terms of Use govern your access to and use of Paramount World Records website and related services. By
				using this website, you agree to these terms.
			</p>

			<h3>1. Eligibility and Account Responsibility</h3>
			<ul style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				<li>You must provide accurate and complete information.</li>
				<li>You are responsible for maintaining account confidentiality.</li>
				<li>You are responsible for all activity under your account.</li>
			</ul>

			<h3>2. Record Applications and Submissions</h3>
			<ul style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				<li>All submissions must be truthful and supported by valid evidence.</li>
				<li>Any false, misleading, or manipulated information may lead to rejection or disqualification.</li>
				<li>We may request additional documents for verification.</li>
			</ul>

			<h3>3. Fees, Payments, and Refunds</h3>
			<p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				Where fees apply, they will be communicated during application flow. Unless otherwise stated in writing, paid
				fees are non-refundable after processing has started.
			</p>

			<h3>4. Verification and Certification</h3>
			<p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				Certification decisions are made based on submitted evidence, adjudication standards, and internal review
				processes. We reserve the right to approve, reject, or revoke recognition where policy violations are found.
			</p>

			<h3>5. Intellectual Property</h3>
			<ul style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				<li>Website content, logos, design assets, and brand materials are owned or licensed by us.</li>
				<li>Unauthorized reproduction, modification, or commercial use is prohibited.</li>
				<li>Use of certificates, badges, or logos must follow our brand and usage guidelines.</li>
			</ul>

			<h3>6. Prohibited Use</h3>
			<ul style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				<li>No unlawful use, abuse, hacking, scraping, or interference with website operations.</li>
				<li>No impersonation, spam, or fraudulent submissions.</li>
				<li>No misuse of the platform to violate rights of others.</li>
			</ul>

			<h3>7. Limitation of Liability</h3>
			<p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				To the maximum extent permitted by law, we are not liable for indirect, incidental, consequential, or special
				damages arising from your use of the website or services.
			</p>

			<h3>8. Suspension and Termination</h3>
			<p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				We may suspend or terminate access to any account that violates these terms, applicable law, or platform
				policies.
			</p>

			<h3>9. Governing Law and Jurisdiction</h3>
			<p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				These terms are governed by the laws of India. Courts with jurisdiction over Mumbai, Maharashtra shall have
				exclusive jurisdiction over related disputes.
			</p>

			<h3>10. Changes to Terms</h3>
			<p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				We may update these terms periodically. Continued use after updates means you accept the revised terms.
			</p>

			<h3>11. Contact</h3>
			<p style="color:var(--text-secondary); line-height:1.7;">
				For queries regarding these terms, contact us through our <a href="/contact">Contact</a> page.
			</p>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>

